{title: Sambhala Hai Maine}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Anu Malik}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [Am],        sambhala hain maine
[C] [Em],        bahot apane dil ko,
[Em],        jubaan par teraa
[B] [Em],        fir bhee naam aa rahaa hai
[Em] [Am],        jahaa raaj ko
[C] [Em],        chhupaayaa naa jaaye,
[Em],        mohabbat mein ayesaa
[B] [Em],        makaam aa rahaa hai
[Em] [D],        banaya hain maine tuze apana sathi,
[D] [A] [Em],        rahe kis tarah fir mere hosh baki
[D] [Em],        rahe kis tarah fir mere hosh baki
[Em] [Am],        najar yoo bahakane
[C] [Em],        lagee hain ke jaise,
[Em],        mere saamane
[B] [Em],        koee jaam aa rahaa hai
[Em] [D],        ye julfon ke badal ghanere ghanere
[D] [A] [Em],        mere bajooon par jo tune bikhere
[D] [Em],        mere baajooon par jo tune bikhere
[Em] [Am],        mai samazaa ke jaise
[C] [Em],        meree dhadakanon ko,
[Em],        teree dhadakanon kaa
[B] [Em],        payaam aa rahaa hai
